  "an4.248:0.3": "6. Paññāvuddhisuttaṃ ",
  "an4.248:1.1": "‘‘Cattārome, bhikkhave, dhammā paññāvuddhiyā saṃvattanti. ",
  "an4.248:1.2": "Katame cattāro? ",
  "an4.248:1.3": "Sappurisasaṃsevo, saddhammasavanaṃ, yonisomanasikāro, dhammānudhammappaṭipatti – ",
  "an4.248:1.4": "ime kho, bhikkhave, cattāro dhammā paññāvuddhiyā saṃvattantī’’ti. ",
  "an4.248:1.5": "Chaṭṭhaṃ. "
}
